		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Étienne annonce les nouveautés de la dernière version d&#039;un autre outil du Dalibo Labs : temBoard.</p><p>temBoard sert à <strong>administrer et de superviser les parcs d&#039;instances PostgreSQL</strong>.</p><p>Voici l&#039;article en français : <a href="https://dali.bo/202309_temboard_8-1_FR" rel="nofollow">temBoard 8.1</a>.</p><br /><p>En anglais :</p><p>Étienne is proud to announce the release of temBoard 8.1. temBoard is a solution to <strong>administer and monitor your PostgreSQL fleet</strong>.</p><p>Read more here:&#160; <a href="https://dali.bo/202309_temboard_8-1_EN" rel="nofollow">temBoard 8.1</a>.</p>]]></content>
